System codecs
-------------

Cropwell does not bundle image codecs. It calls Windows Imaging Component and
uses the JPG, PNG, GIF, TIFF, BMP, WebP, and HEIC codecs installed on the
computer. Those operating-system components are outside the Cropwell binary.
